export anchor AnalyticsForwardStyle:
    number: 16
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Analytics forward
    idea: Charts lead everything, with a large hero chart on top, a sparkline and a delta on every number, and progress rings for projects in deep teal and coral on white.
    base: light
    palette:
        background: #ffffff, the page and cards
        wash: #f2f7f7, the hero stat panel and the last week band in the chart
        ink: #10292c, text and ring labels
        muted: #4f6466, labels, axes and meta text
        grid: #dbe5e6, card borders, gridlines and ring tracks
        teal: #0f5f66, the chart line, the primary button, good deltas, On track and its ring
        tealSoft: #e8f3f3, avatars and the selected row
        coral: #c4452e, the peak marker, the focus outline, the Behind glyph and ring
        coralText: #b23a22, bad deltas, the Behind word and the overdue chip text
        coralSoft: #fbeae6, the overdue chip and the overdue card wash
        amber: #9a5b00, the At risk glyph, word and ring
    type:
        System sans, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica
        Neue, Arial, sans-serif, with tabular figures everywhere. The hero
        figure is 72px light. KPI figures are 36px light. The greeting is
        22px bold, section titles 18px bold, project names 16px bold, body
        15px, deltas 14px bold, and eyebrow labels 12px bold capitals with
        0.08em letter spacing.
    layout:
        A white top bar with a teal chart logo, the wordmark, tabs with a
        3px teal underline on the current one, the search, the New project
        button, the bell with a coral count and the avatar with the name.
        A greeting row puts the greeting and date on the left and a coral
        overdue chip on the right. The hero card comes next and spans the
        full width, a 260px stat panel with 73 tasks completed this week,
        the delta and three small facts beside a large area line chart of
        all 14 days. A row of four KPI cards follows, each with an eyebrow,
        a figure, a sparkline of eight weeks and a delta line. Projects are
        a three by two grid of cards, each with a 72px progress ring, the
        name, a meta line and the status. Activity is one bordered list
        with time, initials and the sentence. Below 1100px the KPIs and
        projects go two across, below 860px the hero stacks, and below
        600px everything is one column and the hero chart scrolls sideways
        inside its card with a hint under it.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 16px gaps between cards and inside them, 24px hero padding and 40px between sections.
    density: Medium. Every figure travels with a chart, a delta and a comparison line.
    corners: 6px on cards, buttons, fields and chips. Avatars and rings are round.
    borders: 1px #dbe5e6 on every card. The overdue KPI card takes a pale coral border and a coral wash fading to white.
    shadows: None. Cards are flat and outlined.
    icons:
        18px line icons with a 2px round stroke for search, bell and plus.
        Deltas use an up arrow or a flat right arrow before a signed
        number. Status glyphs are solid shapes with a white mark, a circle
        with a tick for On track, a diamond with a bar for At risk and a
        down triangle for Behind, always beside the word. The hero chart
        has white dots with teal rings and a larger coral dot labelled 17
        peak.
    focus: A 3px coral outline offset 2px. A focused field also turns its border teal.
    tone: Numeric and comparative, such as +14 · +24%, vs 59 last week, +1 worse and Best day.
